OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hunt after driver killed in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run near Edinburgh Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are searching for two women and
OL,7,Fa man who fled on foot from the scene
OL,8,Fof a fatal hit-and-run crash on the A8
OL,9,Fnear Edinburgh Airport.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,12,Fcrash involving a grey Mercedes A250, a
OL,13,Fblack Renault Captur, a grey Skoda
OL,14,FKaroq and a grey Hyundai i30 between
OL,15,Fthe Newbridge and Gogar roundabouts at
OL,16,Faround 09:25 on Monday.
OL,18,FEmergency services attended, however,
OL,19,Fthe 58-year-old driver of the Hyundai
OL,20,Fi30 was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
